  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「グアバ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B0%E3%82%A2%E3%83%90",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 109805142,
      "text": "グアバ は、フトモモ科に属する熱帯性の低木。または、これと同じバンジロウ属 の約100種の植物の総称。グアバはカール・フォン・リンネの『植物の種』(1753年) で記載された植物の一つである。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Psidium guajava」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psidium_guajava",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1371005524,
      "text": "Psidium guajava, the common guava, yellow guava, lemon guava, or apple guava is an evergreen shrub or small tree native to South America. It is pollinated by insects. When cultivated, it is pollinated mainly by the common honey bee, Apis mellifera."
    }
  },
